'' RUN: a program's own generic TYPE called span replaces the array slice's span( of T )
'' (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003 §1): its instance has the program's field.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -w all tests/codegen/src/array-slice-own-span.tiko -o tests/codegen/arraysliceownspan.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: warning
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/arraysliceownspan.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/arraysliceownspan.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9
